<title>USA: SGV Bancorp buys back 10 pct of stock.</title>
<headline>SGV Bancorp buys back 10 pct of stock.</headline>
<dateline>WEST COVINA, Calif. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGV Bancorp Inc said Wednesday it had repurchased about 10 percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The shares were purchased in open market transactions for an average price of $11.55 per share, it said.</p>
<p>The shares will become treasury shares and will be available for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
